WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.940
May the God of

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.570
hope. That's right.

3
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.610
May the God of hope.

4
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.050
Hey, good job, by the way.

5
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.050
Way to kick off this progressive
discipline this month.

6
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:10.690
You're already there.

7
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.140
May the God of hope.

8
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.930
And you're going to keep hearing
that word all month long.

9
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:22.730
It is all about putting
our hope in Jesus because

10
00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:28.090
he is, man, he is just the
ultimate source of stability,

11
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.690
especially on those days and
those times when you really need

12
00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:35.770
it. I just want to thank
you for joining me today.

13
00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.410
I look forward to these
sessions with you.

14
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.250
I would love to pray for you.

15
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.450
I would love to walk alongside
you if there is anything that I

16
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.650
could do specifically for you.

17
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.050
Do not hesitate to
reach out to me.

18
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:50.250
I can't wait to see you in
your next DAILY FUEL session.

19
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:50.970
Let me pray for us.

20
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:54.330
Heavenly Father, Lord,
you are the God of hope.

21
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.370
And Lord, our prayer today is
that you would fill us with joy,

22
00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.570
Lord, and not just joy,
God, with peace.

23
00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.690
And Lord, we don't want peace
as the world offers peace, which

24
00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:05.930
is the absence of conflict.

25
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.330
Although we could disagree,
we like that, Lord.

26
00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:11.960
We want your peace,
which is shalom.

27
00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:16.130
It is a richness and fullness
and flourishing of life.

28
00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:19.730
It is things as they should be.

29
00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:24.370
And so, Lord, strengthen
our faith, nourish our soul,

30
00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:27.410
and give us what we need
for the workouts of life.

31
00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.580
In Jesus' name, amen.

